  OWASP Dependency-Check suppressions, used by the "OWASP Dependency-Check (SCA)" Jenkins stage.
  Only suppress confirmed false positives or accepted risks, and always say why. The HTML report
  has a "suppress" button next to each finding that generates the entry. Example:

  <suppress until="2027-01-01Z">
    <notes>CVE-XXXX-YYYY: not exploitable, the affected API is not used by the application</notes>
    <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.example/example-lib@.*$</packageUrl>
    <cve>CVE-XXXX-YYYY</cve>
  </suppress>
-->
